inference_trace:
Use a row-by-row bitmask DP. Each row's seating is a bitmask over its `n` columns.

**Valid masks for row `i`:**
- The mask must be a subset of row `i`'s good seats (`'.'` positions).
- No two students may sit side by side, so `(mask & (mask << 1)) == 0`.

**Compatibility between consecutive rows:**
- A student in row `i` can see the upper-left and upper-right seats in row `i-1`.
- So the current mask must not conflict with the previous mask shifted by one in either direction:
  `(cur & (prev << 1)) == 0` and `(cur & (prev >> 1)) == 0`.

**DP:**
- `dp[mask]` is the maximum number of students placed so far, with the current row seated as `mask`.
- For each row, try every valid `cur` against every reachable `prev` that is compatible, and take `dp[prev] + popcount(cur)`.
- Unreachable states are marked with `-1`. Row 0 starts from a virtual previous row with mask 0.

**Complexity:** `m * 4^n` = 8 × 65536 operations, which is small enough.

```csharp
public class Solution {
    public int MaxStudents(char[][] seats) {
        int m = seats.Length, n = seats[0].Length;
        int full = 1 << n;
        int[] dp = new int[full];
        for (int i = 0; i < full; i++) dp[i] = -1;
        dp[0] = 0;
        for (int r = 0; r < m; r++) {
            int avail = 0;
            for (int c = 0; c < n; c++) if (seats[r][c] == '.') avail |= 1 << c;
            int[] nd = new int[full];
            for (int i = 0; i < full; i++) nd[i] = -1;
            for (int cur = 0; cur < full; cur++) {
                if ((cur & ~avail) != 0) continue;
                if ((cur & (cur << 1)) != 0) continue;
                int cnt = 0;
                for (int x = cur; x != 0; x &= x - 1) cnt++;
                for (int prev = 0; prev < full; prev++) {
                    if (dp[prev] < 0) continue;
                    if ((cur & (prev << 1)) != 0 || (cur & (prev >> 1)) != 0) continue;
                    int v = dp[prev] + cnt;
                    if (v > nd[cur]) nd[cur] = v;
                }
            }
            dp = nd;
        }
        int best = 0;
        foreach (int v in dp) if (v > best) best = v;
        return best;
    }
}
```

